Nee code panrathuku VS Code (Visual Studio Code) use panra aalaa iruntha, ithu thaan best vazhi.

Un MEESHO folder-a VS Code-la open pannu.

Left side menu-la 3rd icon (Source Control - oru tree branch madhiri irukkum) click pannu.

Athula "Initialize Repository" nu oru blue button irukkum, atha click pannu.

Mela oru text box varum, athula Initial commit nu type pannitu, pakathula irukka Tick (✓) mark-a click pannu (illa Commit button-a press pannu).

Ippo antha blue button "Publish Branch" nu maaridum. Atha click pannu.

Mela un GitHub account-a authorize panna sollum, allow pannidu. Un repository name kaatum, atha select panna direct-a VS code laye upload aagidum!

Ithula first method romba simple, try pannitu varutha nu sollu!